    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/38c8db395eff02a4e39f05386680223c.avif?t=1744223658\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dungeon CEO's chaotic world, where Victorian-era charm meets strategic mayhem. As the newly appointed CEO of Dungeon Company, you are forced into a world where gods, adventurers, and strange entities lurk beyond the dungeon's walls. What is your mission? Keep your monster workforce alive, manage resources effectively, and earn as much gold as possible\u2014all while striking a delicate balance between profit and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.poster.avif?t=1744223658\" width=798 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.webm?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.mp4?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision in this roguelike strategy card game matters. Hire the best personnel, build a powerful deck, and be ready for tough turn-based fights. Each card in your deck can change the tide of battle by commanding and boosting your forces, allowing you to outwit and overpower your opponents. Defeat enemies to earn cash, grow your dungeon empire, and bring the Dungeon Company to the pinnacle of grandeur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you take your firm to new heights, or will you fall to the turmoil that lurks below?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.poster.avif?t=1744223658\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.webm?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.mp4?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**Note</i></strong><i>: This game is a free demo. The dev team needs support and feedback to continue development.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/38c8db395eff02a4e39f05386680223c.avif?t=1744223658\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Dungeon CEO's chaotic world, where Victorian-era charm meets strategic mayhem. As the newly appointed CEO of Dungeon Company, you are forced into a world where gods, adventurers, and strange entities lurk beyond the dungeon's walls. What is your mission? Keep your monster workforce alive, manage resources effectively, and earn as much gold as possible\u2014all while striking a delicate balance between profit and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.poster.avif?t=1744223658\" width=798 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.webm?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/da6caa0f8be902e073bd91b98b47496c.mp4?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision in this roguelike strategy card game matters. Hire the best personnel, build a powerful deck, and be ready for tough turn-based fights. Each card in your deck can change the tide of battle by commanding and boosting your forces, allowing you to outwit and overpower your opponents. Defeat enemies to earn cash, grow your dungeon empire, and bring the Dungeon Company to the pinnacle of grandeur. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you take your firm to new heights, or will you fall to the turmoil that lurks below?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.poster.avif?t=1744223658\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.webm?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189680/extras/a9e26a7032468cc87a532c7f0bac8ef5.mp4?t=1744223658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>**Note</i></strong><i>: This game is a free demo. The dev team needs support and feedback to continue development.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Take on the role of a Victorian-era Dungeon CEO. Manage resources, recruit monsters, and customize your deck to dominate turn-based fights. Outwit your opponents, acquire coins, and lead the Dungeon Company to victory in a world teeming with adventures and gods.",
